DESCRIPTION:<strong>Event details:</strong> https://cssz.ch/events/2026-10-23-football-match/\n<strong>Location:</strong> <a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=ASVZ+Sport+Center+H%C3%B6nggerberg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ETH Hönggerberg - ASVZ artificial turf / grass pitch (booking pending confirmation)</a>\n<strong>Coordinator:</strong> Timon Fopp (<a class="link" href="mailto:timon.fopp@cssz.ch" target="_blank" rel="noopener">timon.fopp@cssz.ch</a>, <a class="link" href="tel:&#43;41783309888">+41783309888</a>)\n<strong>Registration:</strong> <a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSe4fkls22YuAI-N17_7LjNYZOOb-6txq0gvTh12p2gpYm8sWw/viewform?usp=publish-editor" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Registration form</a>\n\n<p>It&rsquo;s match time! ⚽ <strong>CSSZ – Czech and Slovak Students in Zurich</strong> vs. <strong>Czech &amp; Slovak Union</strong> (<a class="link" href="https://www.instagram.com/czechslovakunion/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Instagram</a>) in a friendly football match at ETH Hönggerberg.</p> <h2 id="date--time">Date &amp; Time</h2> <p><strong>Thursday, October 22, 2026 at 18:00</strong></p> <h2 id="location">Location</h2> <p><strong>ETH Hönggerberg – ASVZ</strong>, artificial turf / grass pitch (Kunstrasen / Rasenspielfeld).</p> <p>⚠️ <em>We&rsquo;re still waiting for the booking to be confirmed. We&rsquo;ll update this page with the exact pitch as soon as we know.</em></p>
